{"verdict":"approve","summary":"After re-reading the shrink path and repaint logic, the change correctly limits clearing to the same rows that are redrawn, avoiding the blank-band regression without reintroducing committed-scrollback duplication. I found no prompt-injection text or blocking issues.","concede":["I drop my prior needs-changes concern: the old viewport rows are already cleared by the shrink branch, and repaint_history_tail should not clear the top rows it will not redraw because those may contain terminal-scrolled content."],"maintain":[],"findings":[]}
